brust-tokio-1+sync-dev (>= 1.44.0)\r\n    provides:\r\n    - librust-tokio-util-0+net-dev\r\n    - librust-tokio-util-0.7+net-dev\r\n    - librust-tokio-util-0.7.18+net-dev\r\n    breaks:\r\n    - rustc (<< 1.71~)\r\n    multi-arch: same\r\n  librust-tokio-util+rt-dev:\r\n    architectures: any\r\n    summary: Additional utilities for working with Tokio - feature \"rt\"\r\n    description: This metapackage enables feature \"rt\" for the Rust tokio-util crate, by pulling in any additional dependencies needed by that feature.\r\n    depends:\r\n    - librust-tokio-util-dev\r\n    - librust-tokio-util+futures-util-dev\r\n    - librust-tokio-1+rt-dev (>= 1.44.0)\r\n    - librust-tokio-1+sync-dev (>= 1.44.0)\r\n    provides:\r\n    - librust-tokio-util-0+rt-dev\r\n    - librust-tokio-util-0.7+rt-dev\r\n    - librust-tokio-util-0.7.18+rt-dev\r\n    breaks:\r\n    - rustc (<< 1.71~)\r\n    multi-arch: same\r\n  librust-tokio-util+slab-dev:\r\n    architectures: any\r\n    summary: Additional utilities for working with Tokio - feature \"slab\"\r\n    description: This metapackage enables feature \"slab\" for the Rust tokio-util crate, by pulling in any additional dependencies needed by that feature.\r\n    depends:\r\n    - librust-tokio-util-dev\r\n    - librust-slab-0.4+default-dev (>= 0.4.4)\r\n    provides:\r\n    - librust-tokio-util-0+slab-dev\r\n    - librust-tokio-util-0.7+slab-dev\r\n    - librust-tokio-util-0.7.18+slab-dev\r\n    breaks:\r\n    - rustc (<< 1.71~)\r\n    multi-arch: same\r\n  librust-tokio-util+time-dev:\r\n    architectures: any\r\n    summary: Additional utilities for working with Tokio - feature \"time\"\r\n    description: This metapackage enables feature \"time\" for the Rust tokio-util crate, by pulling in any additional dependencies needed by that feature.\r\n    depends:\r\n    - librust-tokio-util-dev\r\n    - librust-tokio-util+slab-dev\r\n    - librust-tokio-1+sync-dev (>= 1.44.0)\r\n    - librust-tokio-1+time-dev (>= 1.44.0)\r\n    provides:\r\n    - librust-tokio-util-0+time-dev\r\n    - librust-tokio-util-0.7+time-dev\r\n    - librust-tokio-util-0.7.18+time-dev\r\n    breaks:\r\n    - rustc (<< 1.71~)\r\n    multi-arch: same\r\n  librust-tokio-util+tracing-dev:\r\n    architectures: any\r\n    summary: Additional utilities for working with Tokio - feature \"tracing\"\r\n    description: This metapackage enables feature \"tracing\" for the Rust tokio-util crate, by pulling in any additional dependencies needed by that feature.\r\n    depends:\r\n    - librust-tokio-util-dev\r\n    - librust-tracing-0.1+std-dev (>= 0.1.29)\r\n    provides:\r\n    - librust-tokio-util-0+tracing-dev\r\n    - librust-tokio-util-0.7+tracing-dev\r\n    - librust-tokio-util-0.7.18+tracing-dev\r\n    breaks:\r\n    - rustc (<< 1.71~)\r\n    multi-arch: same\r\n  librust-tokio-util-dev:\r\n    architectures: any\r\n    summary: Additional utilities for working with Tokio - Rust source code\r\n    description: Source code for Debianized Rust crate \"tokio-util\"\r\n    depends:\r\n    - librust-bytes-1+default-dev (>= 1.5.0)\r\n    - librust-futures-core-0.3+default-dev\r\n    - librust-futures-sink-0.3+default-dev\r\n    - librust-pin-project-lite-0.2+default-dev (>= 0.2.11)\r\n    - librust-tokio-1+default-dev (>= 1.44.0)\r\n    - librust-tokio-1+sync-dev (>= 1.44.0)\r\n    suggests:\r\n    - librust-tokio-util+full-dev\r\n    - librust-tokio-util+futures-io-dev\r\n    - librust-tokio-util+futures-util-dev\r\n    - librust-tokio-util+hashbrown-dev\r\n    - librust-tokio-util+io-util-dev\r\n    - librust-tokio-util+join-map-dev\r\n    - librust-tokio-util+net-dev\r\n    - librust-tokio-util+rt-dev\r\n    - librust-tokio-util+slab-dev\r\n    - librust-tokio-util+time-dev\r\n    - librust-tokio-util+tracing-dev\r\n    provides:\r\n    - librust-tokio-util+codec-dev\r\n    - librust-tokio-util+default-dev\r\n    - librust-tokio-util+io-dev\r\n    - librust-tokio-util-0-dev\r\n    - librust-tokio-util-0+codec-dev\r\n    - lib