[0.499295, "o", "\u001b[1;38;2;255;165;0m\t •  .demo-output.n0DcVU/tokio-util-traditional/debian/copyright\u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[1;38;2;255;165;0m\u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[1;38;2;255;165;0mTo fix, try combinations of the following: \u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[1;38;2;255;165;0m\t •  Write a config file and use it with --config\u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[1;38;2;255;165;0m\t •  Create an overlay directory and add it to your config file with overlay = \"/path/to/overlay\"\u001b[0m\r\n"]
